<section class="bg-white px-6 py-16 md:py-24 section-rule">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[45fr_55fr] gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Photo — REPLACE WITH REAL PHOTO of Tizita -->
      <div style="max-width:420px;">
        <div style="aspect-ratio:4/5; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; background:#EAE7E1;">
          <img
            src="/images/tizita.svg"
            alt="Tizita, owner and primary caregiver at Lulu's Care in Everett, WA"
            style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
<h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,2.75rem); line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; font-weight:400; color:#111111; margin:0;">
          Meet Tizita
        </h2>
        <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; font-size:17px; color:rgba(17,17,17,0.72); line-height:1.65;">
          <p style="margin:0;">I opened Lulu's Care because I wanted to give families in Everett an option I could genuinely stand behind — a real home, not a facility.</p>
          <p style="margin:0;">Care here follows each resident's routine, not the other way around. I know every person by name, and I know what a good day looks like for each of them.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/about"
          style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:var(--color-brand-sage); margin-top:4px; text-decoration:none;"
          class="hover:text-brand-terra transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          Read our story <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
